    // 1. Swapped language fields: the German bundle currently resolves these
    //    task names to the English string "New Beginning" instead of
    //    "Neuanfang". src/overrides/locales/en.json5 already fixes the
    //    mirror-image bug on the English side (that bundle resolves to the
    //    German "Neuanfang"). See that file's header for the full context and
    //    proof link (https://json.tarkov.dev/regular/tasks_en).
