    // 2. Stale English in the figurine handover objectives: the German
    //    bundle held an OLDER English phrasing of these objectives. Upstream
    //    has since reworded the English side to "any ... figurine"; the
    //    German bundle never picked up either the translation or the reword,
    //    so it still reads plain English throughout.
    //    Proof: https://json.tarkov.dev/regular/tasks_en
